  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Serbia at Your Fingertips &#x2013; Digital Transformation for Development, Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building on the successful first phase of the project &#x201c;Serbia at Your Fingertips &#x2013; Digital Transformation for Development&#x201d; &#x2013; which saw the Office for IT and e-Government (ITE) evolve from a small team into a well-established organization with 150 employees, operating the largest regional data center and a digital services portal serving over 2 million people &#x2013; Phase 2 will continue to strengthen the pillars of Serbia&#x2019;s digital growth. In this new phase, the project will further enhance ITE&#x2019;s cap</narrative>
  </description>
